    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You transform the target’s brain, allowing them to see sounds, hear scents, and otherwise perceive sensory input using multiple sensory organs. Even unusual senses, such as a @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.races.Item.VIJ6pdOVTJle3vJx]{Shirren}’s vibration sense, are affected. For the duration of the spell, the target is immune to the @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.tOpF6qjnlnKc10t7]{Blinded}, @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.YjE6UGzwOTfO9p4g]{Dazzled}, and @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.D8JvCEmOiWKe2UDx]{Deafened} conditions and gains a +2 enhancement bonus to Perception checks.</p>"
    },
